      "en": "A good man shall obtain favor from the LORD, but he will condemn a man of wicked plans.",
      "ko": "선인은 여호와께 은총을 받으려니와 악을 꾀하는 자는 정죄하심을 받으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "1e11b50eb6ced2abf3d028bc8efac7d2059f6b2eec4d8a3de16e2609548ab40d",
      "translation_text_hash": "7a4a1ea16b631820a5233766b9dc5eb9b828665e3f169985ca792f9f9668dc8b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
